<title>USA: US to donate wheat to Kyrgyzstan under PL480.</title>
<headline>US to donate wheat to Kyrgyzstan under PL480.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department Friday said it will donate $15 million worth of wheat or up to 60,000 tonnes to Kyrgyzstan under the Public Law 480, Title I Food For Peace program (PL480).</p>
<p>The supply period for the donation is fiscal year 1997.</p>
</text>
